{
  "name": "飞书工作环境",
  "description": "安装官方 lark-cli，并以 Agent 绑定的飞书机器人身份调用开放平台。需要运行节点能够访问飞书开放平台。",
  "environment": "openai_hosted",
  "packages": { "npm": ["@larksuite/cli@1.0.98"], "python": [] },
  "env": {
    "npm_config_ignore_scripts": "true",
    "LARKSUITE_CLI_DEFAULT_AS": "bot",
    "LARKSUITE_CLI_STRICT_MODE": "bot",
    "LARKSUITE_CLI_NO_UPDATE_NOTIFIER": "1",
    "LARKSUITE_CLI_NO_SKILLS_NOTIFIER": "1",
    "LARKSUITE_CLI_CONFIG_DIR": "/workspace/.lark-cli",
    "LARKSUITE_CLI_DATA_DIR": "/workspace/.lark-cli/data"
  },
  "bot_env": {
    "FEISHU_APP_ID": "app_id",
    "FEISHU_APP_SECRET": "app_secret",
    "FEISHU_BRAND": "brand"
  },
  "files": [
    { "path": "/workspace/WORKSPACE.md", "content": "# 飞书工作环境\n\n官方 lark-cli 已在 Agent 启动前安装，以 Agent 绑定的飞书机器人身份运行。禁止输出 App Secret、令牌或环境变量。读取 Skill 后使用具体业务命令。网络错误与权限不足分别报告。产物写到 ./outputs。\n" }
  ]
}
